        :relatedStudies      <https://www.synapse.org/#!Synapse:syn7239479> ;
        :relatedStudies      <https://www.synapse.org/#!Synapse:syn26238964> ;
        :description         "Preliminary High-throughput screening (HTS) data generated at National Center for Advancing Translational Sciences (NCATS) implicated a number of different compounds as potential candidates and combinations suitable for moving forward to preclinical testing, with nine combinations prioritized for validation in murine primary embryonic Schwann cell lines and/or immortalized cell lines. The goal of these experiments was to validate the results of preliminary HTS at NIH/NCATS by Dr. Ferrer." ;
