        :studyLeads          "David Gutmann" ;
        :description         "Low-grade gliomas (LGGs) are brain tumors that affect children with NF1. Despite their prevalence, there are few effective treatment options for patients with LGG. The goal of the Synodos for NF1 - Low Grade Glioma projects is to improve our understanding of the molecular underpinnings of LGGs, and identify new drug targets that could lead to better treatments for this tumor type." ;
        :dataStatus          "Under Embargo" ;
        :initiative          "Synodos" ;
        :manifestation       :Low_Grade_Glioma ;
