        :studyLeads                 "Antonio Iavarone" ;
        :acknowledgementStatements  "If you use data from this study in a publication or talk, please cite the following publication: \"D�Angelo, F., Ceccarelli, M., Tala et al. The molecular landscape of glioma in patients with Neurofibromatosis 1. Nat Med 25, 176�187 (2019). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41591-018-0263-8\" In addition, please acknowledge the NF Data Portal using the following statement: \"The results published here are in whole or in part based on data obtained from the NF Data Portal (http://www.nfdataportal.org) and made available through the NF Open Science Initiative." ;
        :institutions               "Columbia University" ;
