        :description         "For this initiative, we have designed experiments that focus on validating the newly-identified Schwann cell growth factors, demonstrating that they are both sufficient and necessary for hiPSC-sensory neuron-driven paracrine regulation of NF1-deficient SC growth, and identifying molecular targets to block sensory neuron production of these growth factors and/or their ability to induce NF1-deficient SC growth relevant to human neurofibroma pathobiology." ;
